    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
    "body": "Yeah, this was more a poc change to see if the resulting functionality of the widgets is correct. You can check via the sandbox linked above. Basically breadcrumb will only pick up hierarchical menu facets and ignore menu ones.\r\n\r\nI think a better way would be to use `hierarchicalFacetName` which is used throughout the connector. I've made this change in the latest commit, let me know if you think it's correct. I'll add some test cases for it in that case.",
